# Line-ending conversion is disabled for the whole repo, on purpose.
#
# Several files here are encoding-sensitive (see HANDOFF.md 6.12):
#
#   * the .ps1 scripts carry a UTF-8 BOM - without it Windows PowerShell decodes
#     them as GBK, truncates the Chinese strings and fails to parse;
#   * launch-adofai-hidden.vbs is UTF-16LE;
#   * the .cs sources are handed straight to csc.exe.
#
# `* -text` stores every blob byte-for-byte and never rewrites endings on
# checkout. Diff still works normally; only normalisation is off.
* -text
